//! Read side of the local asset pack: [`AssetPack::load`] parses what
//! [`pack_format`] writes, which owns the layout and id scheme.
//!
//! The pack is generated by `cargo xtask extract` and never committed.
//! [`PackError`] is separate from [`crate::error::AssetError`]; see
//! [`crate::error`].

